{"id": "141788", "name": "מציאת בסיס אורתונורמלי לתת-מרחב", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "innerproduct", "params": ["x", "y"], "body": "block([listarith],listarith:true,ratsimp(conjugate(x).y))"}, {"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}, {"name": "inSpan", "params": ["veclst1", "veclst2"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst1)) = rank(matrify(append(veclst1,veclst2))))"}, {"name": "prod", "params": ["u", "v"], "body": "rootscontract(simplify(rootscontract(simplify(rootscontract(expand(transpose(u).v))))))"}, {"name": "perpp", "params": ["u", "v"], "body": "is(prod(u,v)=0)"}, {"name": "unitvectp", "params": ["u"], "body": "is(prod(u,u)=1)"}, {"name": "unitvectify", "params": ["u"], "body": "block([norm: sqrt(prod(u,u))], if (norm=0) then u else (u/norm))"}, {"name": "alltrue", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "emptyp(delete(true,map(pred, lst)))"}, {"name": "colp", "params": ["v"], "body": "if (matrixp(v)) then is(length(v)=n and length(transpose(v))=1) else false"}, {"name": "collistp", "params": ["lst"], "body": "alltrue(colp,lst)"}, {"name": "leavefalses", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "sublist(lst,lambda([ex],not pred(ex)))"}, {"name": "pairs", "params": ["n"], "body": "block(lst: [],for i:1 thru (n-1) do(for j:i+1 thru n do(lst: endcons([i,j],lst))), lst)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון תת-מרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^4\\)</span> ע\"י</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[W = \\text{span}\\left\\{{{CT:0}}, {{CT:1}}, {{CT:2}}\\right\\}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו בסיס אורתונורמלי למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> שנסמנו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B=\\{v_1,v_2,v_3\\}\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v_1=\\) [[input:v1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:v1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v_2=\\) [[input:v2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:v2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v_3=\\) [[input:v3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:v3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "v1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "v2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "v3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "ans1:[v1,v2,v3];\n\nvalidInput: collistp(ans1);\nans: if (validInput) then ans1 else [];\n\nnotinW: leavefalses(lambda([v],inSpan(B,[v])),ans);\nindependent: not dependentvects(ans);\nspanning: inSpan(ans,B);\n\nnonunits: leavefalses(unitvectp,ans);\n\nperpidxs(idxs):= perpp(ans[idxs[1]],ans[idxs[2]]);\nnonperp: leavefalses(perpidxs, pairs(length(ans)));\nnonperpex: if (nonperp=[]) then 0 else first(nonperp);\n\nperfect: is(validInput and notinW=[] and independent and spanning and nonunits=[] and nonperp=[]);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "validInput", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">ברשימה שהזנת כבסיס אורתונורמלי למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> קיימים איברים שאינם וקטורי עמודה מהגודל הנכון.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "notinW", "tans": "[]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בין הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס אורתונורמלי למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> יש וקטורים שאינם שייכים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span>. למשל: {@first(notinW)@}</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "independent", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> תלויים לינארית.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "spanning", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס אורתונורמלי למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> אינם פורשים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "nonunits", "tans": "[]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">לא כל הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס אורתונורמלי למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> הם וקטורי יחידה. הבאים אינם וקטורים מנורמה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1\\)</span>: {@nonunits@}</div>"}}, {"name": 5, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "nonperp", "tans": "[]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 6, "answernote": "prt1-6-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 6, "answernote": "prt1-6-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">לא כל הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס אורתונורמלי למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> מאונכים זה לזה. למשל עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v={@ans[nonperpex[1]]@}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={@ans[nonperpex[2]]@}\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((v,u) = {@prod(ans[nonperpex[1]],ans[nonperpex[2]])@}\\)</span></div>"}}, {"name": 6, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "perfect", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-7-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-7-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["B", "k", "n", "possibleans"], "nvariants": 50}